<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7263] Daemon-mode Ignite node should not open&amp;listen client port (10800)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7263</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When I run a Visor console with default configuration file it opens a default port (10800) for ODBC driver connection (and for thin JDBC, and for new &quot;thin&quot; client).&lt;br/&gt;
Then I run several Ignite nodes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So after that, the ODBC driver with default settings goes directly to a Visor (daemon-mode Ignite) and does not able to get any data (daemon-mode Ignite does not keep any data)&lt;br/&gt;
It is better to avoid such situation.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
